          <id>Point06</id>
          <title>作品簡介/ Artwork Introduction</title>
          <description>Dreamland III

謝貽娟短短五十年的一生，卻畫有1600餘張的自畫像，從1993年起，她每日都在英國住處的角落畫自畫像，間或持續至1999年。這張版畫算是自畫像的第一張，由四個方塊組成的構圖中，中間為謝貽娟人像，周圍以線條表現頭髮、物象和自然，再以灰黑和黃之對比，呈現多樣的面貌以及標題中的「夢境」。

During her short life of 50 years, Jo Hsieh produced over 1,600 self-portraits. From 1993 to 1999, she created one almost every day in a corner of her residence in the UK. Considered the first of these self-portraits, this print is composed of four rectangular sections, with Hsieh’s image at the center surrounded by linear depictions of hair, objects, and nature. The contrast between gray-black and yellow presents varied visual elements and suggests the “dreamland” of the title.</description>
