          <id>Point04</id>
          <title>作品簡介/ Artwork Introduction</title>
          <description>婚禮/ The Wedding

這件作品創作於李錦繡探索自我的時期，當時的她經常以群像為主軸，繪寫家族、婚姻與密不可分的親情。李錦繡曾在論文中提及自己喜愛灰色，因為其模糊性及曖昧性。這件作品以灰黑、模糊的形式呈現家族婚禮合照場景，一改清晰的模樣，借用攝影負片的效果，反轉明暗與黑白的關係，在灰色與黑色的主調中留下人形和輪廓。

This work was created during the period when Lii Jiin Shiow focused on the exploration of the self, often using group portraits to depict family, marriage, and the deep bonds of kinship. Lii once expressed in her essay her fondness for the color gray because of its obscurity and ambiguity. Subverting photographic clarity, this work features a blurred, gray-black toned family wedding portrait. It draws on the effects of negative imagery to reverse the relationship between light and dark, black and white, leaving silhouetted figures in a gray-black palette.</description>
          <linktype>info</linktype>
          <linksubtype>unknown</linksubtype>
