          <customprops/>
          <polygon/>
          <id>Point05</id>
          <title>作品簡介/ Artwork Introduction</title>
          <description>對影/ A Pair of Shadows

1970年代中期，李錦繡展開長達七年的家族照片系列創作。這系列靈感來自攝影底片的負片效果，經常以灰、黑色為基調，主題為個人生命、日常生活，描繪對象為家人手足、同學朋友。最初畫面經常有黑色團塊圍繞在人物周邊，形成畫面空間的層次。本作《對影》以弟弟李英哲為對象，畫面中兩個人物以相同的坐姿前後並列，神貌模糊，具有相似又相異的趣味。

In the mid-1970s, Lii Jiin Shiow began a seven-year series of works based on family photographs. Inspired by the effects of negative imagery, this series often features gray and black as its dominant tones and explores themes of personal life and everyday experience, depicting family members, siblings, classmates, and friends. In the early pieces of this series, black masses frequently surround the figures to create a layered pictorial space. This work, A Pair on Shadows, portrays the artist’s younger brother, Lii Ying-che. With their faces rendered ambiguously, the two figures sit one behind the other in identical postures, showing interesting resemblances and differences.</description>
          <linktype>info</linktype>
          <linksubtype>unknown</linksubtype>
          <skinid>ht_info</skinid>
