        </hotspot>
        <hotspot>
          <position>
            <pan>-27.26</pan>
            <tilt>16.16</tilt>
            <fov>10</fov>
          </position>
          <next>
            <pan>0</pan>
            <tilt>0</tilt>
            <fov>0</fov>
          </next>
          <customprops/>
          <polygon/>
          <id>Point04</id>
          <title>作品簡介/ Artwork Introduction</title>
          <description>時空記憶（獨）/ Memory of Space and Time (alone)

李錦繡曾說：「透明的空間，我的存在應也是透明自在。」1990年代之後，家中的室內空間成為李錦繡主要的作畫題材，從早期自畫像到後期家居空間，可以看見畫家從人物、自我的變化，移情至物件和空間。李錦繡一生大部分時間都奉獻給家人，她在家中有限的空間中作畫，灰色調成為模糊和沒有界線的延伸，顯得透明自在。畫中一張色彩明亮的「椅子」，成為她寄情自我的載體，最終也是一種自我存在的遨遊與自由，造就屬於自己的另一種「自畫像」。

Lii Jiin Shiow once said: “In a transparent space, my existence should also be transparent and free.” From the 1990s onward, the interior space of her home became the main theme of her work. From early self-portraits to later depictions of domestic interiors, the artist gradually shifted her focus from figures and personal changes to objects and space. With most of her life dedicated to her family, Lii painted within the confined space of her home. The gray tones in her work evoke a sense of obscurity and boundlessness, conveying feelings of transparency and ease. In this painting, a brightly colored “chair” becomes a symbol of self-expression, which ultimately represents a free and roaming existence, and forms an alternative “self-portrait.” </description>
          <linktype>info</linktype>
          <linksubtype>unknown</linksubtype>
          <skinid>ht_info</skinid>
