          <customprops/>
          <polygon/>
          <id>Point05</id>
          <title>作品簡介/ Artwork Introduction</title>
          <description>無題/ Untitled

謝貽娟說：「藍色是沈靜的，不張狂的，一種理性的姿態，一種精神上的穩定，一種心靈上的平衡。」在探索自然與物理世界的表象、內容之間，她最終用單色、幾何的方式，呈現自身收穫與感知，在一片藍色礦物粉末中，濃縮世界觀與精神性的參透。創作中的勞動也是謝貽娟找尋自我與體悟的過程，她說「沒有人懂我在說什麼，只有畫畫懂我」，畫是她自己，一片藍色和純粹的幾何，是她自處與延伸的宇宙，也是她所凝鍊的「自畫像」。

Jo Hsieh said: “The color blue, calm and unassuming, is a rational stance, a mental steadiness, and a spiritual balance.” While exploring the representations and essences of the natural and physical world, she ultimately turned to monochromic and geometric forms to express her own insights and perceptions. Within the blue mineral powder, she distilled a worldview and spiritual clarity. In Hsieh’s work, the labor of creative practice is also the process of discovering and understanding the self. She said: “No one understands what I am saying, except painting.” Painting represents herself, while the blue tones and pure geometry form a universe where she both dwelt and expanded, as well as the “self-portraits” she carefully crafted.  </description>
          <linktype>info</linktype>
          <linksubtype>unknown</linksubtype>
