          <customprops/>
          <polygon/>
          <id>Point04</id>
          <title>作品資訊/ Artwork Information</title>
          <description>無憂無慮 Free of Worries
蓄意的 With Purpose
2025
鐵雕和風有關，過度用力會傷了時間；凝視材料， 拆解與再造，羞澀且沉重的雙腿，浮上了聲響。
這組作品來自彼此，命中有命；鐵雕與愛有關，絮語與叨唸，很難分得清，看著《無憂無慮》線之流動，自動長出了肉感的心臟。
My metal sculptures are connected to the wind; too much force can wound time. I gaze into the materials, dismantling and reconstructing them. Shy and heavy legs resonate with sound.
These works are born of each other, each carrying a life within a life. The metal sculptures are intertwined with love, with whispers and mutterings that are hardly distinguishable. As your eyes follow the flowing lines of Free of Worries, a fleshy heart quietly appears.</description>
          <linktype>info</linktype>
          <linksubtype>unknown</linksubtype>
          <safeurl>2F_w150_h230mm.pdf</safeurl>
