          <title>藝術家介紹/ Artist Introduce</title>
          <description>蔡志賢（1958-）
TSAI Chih-hsien
出身嘉義，鐵雕藝術家。擅長以「即成物」（found objects）進行創作，以焊接、拼組與重構，賦予物件新的生命。作品偏好抽象及半抽象，美學風格深沉且內斂。
Tsai Chih-hsien is a metal sculptor from Chiayi. Skillfully working with found objects, he gives them new life through welding, assemblage, and reconstruction. His works are primarily abstract or semi-abstract, characterized by a profound and understated aesthetic.</description>
