          <customprops/>
          <polygon/>
          <id>Point05</id>
          <title>作品簡介/ Artwork Introduction</title>
          <description>通靈/ Psychic

李錦繡於留法前後，即已積極在紙上探索空間、具象及抽象的關係，有時是有生命體及無生命體之結合，有時是尺度之於空間的、幾何的變形。               從她的速寫本之中，可以看到她從人像到物象之間的捕捉與探索，若再對照《通靈》一作，畫中的椅子是焦點，藍色區域中的線條，延伸至後景中看似人像的團塊，既抽象又具象，也開啟了李錦繡日後表現畫面分割、以物寄情和象徵自處的方式。

Around the time she left for France, Lii Jiin Shiow was already actively exploring the relationship among space, figuration, and abstraction on paper, sometimes combining animate and inanimate forms, and sometimes engaging with spatial scale and geometric transformation. Her sketchbooks reveal her captures and explorations ranging from human figures to object imagery. In comparison, this painting, Psychic, focuses on a chair with lines within the blue area extending toward a human-like mass in the background. Both abstract and figurative, the work anticipates Lii’s later approach to pictorial segmentation, emotional expression through objects, and symbolic reflections on selfhood.</description>
          <linktype>info</linktype>
