          <id>Point07</id>
          <title>作品簡介/ Artwork Introduction</title>
          <description>謝貽娟擅長以畫筆展現不同媒材和材料的質地。本件《無題》以畫筆呈現出纖維般的的質感，繽紛的色塊呈現拼布的樣態，錯落的顏色也表現出她作品中常見的音樂性，也造就出童趣。本作可搭配她筆記本一起觀看，尤其是其中的色彩和圖騰表現。 

Jo Hsieh was skilled at using the brush to express the textures of various materials. In Untitled, brushstrokes render a fibrous surface, while vibrant blocks of color resemble a patchwork composition. The interplay of hues reflects the musicality often seen in her works and conveys a sense of childlike fun. This work may be viewed alongside her notebooks, particularly in relation to her use of color and totemic forms.</description>
          <linktype>info</linktype>
          <linksubtype>unknown</linksubtype>
