          <id>Point04</id>
          <title>藝術家介紹/ Artist Introduce</title>
          <description>王怡婷（1985-）
WANG Yi-ting
擅長自然材質的立體裝置或雕塑，作品經常運用空間構畫出與時間、空間、物質、影像、和能量之間的韻律關係，以詩意語言與敏銳感知構築流動的精神風景。
Wang Yi-ting is adept at creating three-dimensional installations and sculptures with natural materials. Her work often employs space to compose rhythmic relationships among time, space, material, image, and energy, constructing fluid spiritual landscapes shaped by poetic language and acute perception.</description>
          <linktype>info</linktype>
          <linksubtype>unknown</linksubtype>
          <safeurl>_w150_h285mm.pdf</safeurl>
          <target>_blank</target>
          <skinid>ht_info</skinid>
          <type>point</type>
