          <polygon/>
          <id>Point04</id>
          <title>作品介紹/ Artwork Introduction</title>
          <description>無題/ Untitled

本作在一層上了底色的紙張上，嘗試以油彩畫上彎繞的線條，再繪製直向的線條，並陸續加入不同顏色的曲線，由細轉粗，增加力道與速度。漸漸地，油畫顏料和紙的纖維產生突起和肌理，每條線也出現毛邊與裂縫。謝貽娟在連續的轉動與來回之間，在動態的身體與重複的形式中，結構出平面之中多層次的韻律感。

On a sheet of primed paper, this work experiments with curved lines drawn in oil paint, adding straight lines and gradually incorporating thin to thick curves of different colors to intensify force and speed. Progressively, the oil paint and paper fibers produce raised textures, with each line developing frayed edges and cracks. Through continuously rotating and back-and-forth brushstrokes, Jo Hsieh employs a dynamic gesture and repetitive forms to compose a multilayered sense of rhythm on a flat surface.</description>
          <linktype>info</linktype>
          <linksubtype>unknown</linksubtype>
          <skinid>ht_info</skinid>
