          <polygon/>
          <id>Point07</id>
          <title>作品介紹/ Artwork Introduction</title>
          <description>無題/ Untitled

「手」作為謝貽娟創作時重要工具，她時常徒手於畫面上推開礦物粉末，進入無邊的深沉的藍色之中，再以具有穿透力的的金銀礦物粉末，堆積出畫面中的肌理和層次，創造出光影的變化。媒材與媒材之間的接觸和疊合，也像是空間與空間的交疊，透過不同的光線和角度觀察，會有不同的感受。 

The hand was a vital tool in Jo Hsieh’s creative process. She often spread mineral powder across the surface with her bare hands, immersing herself in the boundless depth of blue. With the addition of penetrating gold and silver powders, she built up textures and layers that produce shifting effects of light and shadow. In the resulting works, the contact and overlap between materials evoke the interweaving of spaces, offering varied sensory experiences when viewed from different angles and under changing light.</description>
          <linktype>info</linktype>
          <linksubtype>unknown</linksubtype>
          <skinid>ht_info</skinid>
