          <polygon/>
          <id>Point04</id>
          <title>作品介紹/ Artwork Introduction</title>
          <description>牽扯/ Involvement

李錦繡拜師嘉義書法家陳丁奇鑽研書道，將書法的線性、飛白等融入於繪畫創作的線條，寫字的韌勁用於作畫上，成為樹木恣意生長的生命力。《牽扯》同樣展現著李錦繡偏愛的灰色調，加上白色以及充滿生命韌性的黑色線條，表現樹木生長的枝幹以及蜷曲向上的力量。

Lii Jiin Shiow studied calligraphy under the Chiayi-based calligrapher Chen Ding-chi. She incorporated calligraphic elements such as lines and hollow strokes into the lines of her paintings, and applied the force of calligraphic brushwork to render her works, creating the vitality of freely growing trees. The work Involvement showcases Lii’s signature gray palette, enhanced with white and dynamic black lines that embody strength and life, symbolizing the growing branches and their upward, spiraling force. </description>
          <linktype>info</linktype>
          <linksubtype>unknown</linksubtype>
          <skinid>ht_info</skinid>
          <type>point</type>
