          <title>藝術家介紹/ Artist Introduction</title>
          <description>康雅筑（1980-）
KANG Ya-chu
擅長運用纖維編織、自然材質等複合媒材，探討工藝技能與體力勞動、生活狀態與遷徙移動、經濟貿易與社會結構之間的關係，主題經常探討身份、人與自然關係，以及社會環境等議題。
Kang Ya-chu works with mixed media, including woven fibers and natural materials, to explore the relationships between craftsmanship and physical labor, everyday life and migration, as well as economic trade and social structures. Her work often addresses themes such as identity, the human-nature relationship, and the social environment.</description>
          <linktype>info</linktype>
          <linksubtype>unknown</linksubtype>
